# RAM-backed ephemeral dir (per CLAUDE.md: tmp/ is symlinked to a
# system tmp directory for logs and other ephemeral output)
tmp/
tmp

# Phase 3 build artifacts (issue 309)
build/
*.o
*.so
*.dylib
soramech-pool

# Per-map compile artifacts produced by scripts/soramech-compile.sh.
# Derived from the source map and the language plugins; regenerated
# with `scripts/soramech-compile.sh <map>`. Issue 315 adds the
# sibling-generation pattern (compiled.1/, compiled.2/, …) for
# fork-on-live-references — every generation is derived, so the
# whole family is ignored.
tests/maps/*/compiled/
tests/maps/*/compiled.*/

# Linux coredumps — the kernel core_pattern drops these at the cwd
# of the crashing process, which is usually the project root.
core.*

# Map directories at the project root — user content, not part of
# project source. Editor / runner state lives here per design.
# Includes compiled/ artifacts (issue 309) and run logs (issue 311).
#
# Path is anchored with `/` so test fixtures under tests/maps/ (used
# by issue 311's integration tests) remain tracked.
/maps/

# Editor / IDE / OS temp files
*.tmp
*.tmp.*
*~
*.swp
*.bak
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Lua bytecode
*.luac
